<title>USA: NewCare Health president/CEO Bell resigns.</title>
<headline>NewCare Health president/CEO Bell resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LARGO, FLA. 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>NewCare Health Corp said its President and Chief Executive Robert Bell resigned from the company.</p>
<p>Officials from the company were not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>Bell will continue to work for the company on a part-time basis and will remain as a director until the next shareholders' meeting, the company said.</p>
<p>Ashok Dalal will serve as chief executive officer on an interim basis, the company added.</p>
